efully to maintain compliance.\n**Considering schema for claims**\n\nI’m thinking about how the evidence excerpts may relate to claims and whether to keep empty arrays. The schema doesn't require it, but including them could improve quality. I’m wondering if it’s beneficial to have evidence excerpts for each claim, but maybe that's too repetitive. Claims can just include text and a short title. Adding a \"claim_id\" could be useful since the schema allows for additional properties. I need to ensure I stick to schema-allowed fields without inventing anything unsupported."}}
